{"4616090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Transcendence in the Poolrooms", "steam_appid": 4616090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transcendence in the Poolrooms is a liminal space adventure game set in an unending world of pools. Warm water and tiled walls extend infinitely beckoning you into a place that you may never escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-based gameplay in a liminal space</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unending spaces which look so real yet have an unmistakably uncanny character to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pools themselves are hostile to you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile entities are not found here, instead the pools themselves are working against you, doing anything they can to destroy you like they have other travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will solve simple puzzles in order to traverse this zone and collect bizarre artifacts that have unusual properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas are hidden in these winding hallways which will reward travelers who are willing to find them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transcendence in the Poolrooms is a liminal space adventure game set in an unending world of pools. Warm water and tiled walls extend infinitely beckoning you into a place that you may never escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-based gameplay in a liminal space</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unending spaces which look so real yet have an unmistakably uncanny character to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pools themselves are hostile to you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile entities are not found here, instead the pools themselves are working against you, doing anything they can to destroy you like they have other travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will solve simple puzzles in order to traverse this zone and collect bizarre artifacts that have unusual properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas are hidden in these winding hallways which will reward travelers who are willing to find them.</p>", "short_description": "Transcendence in the Poolrooms is an adventure game where you will experience infinite relaxation. Fall into another world where you will explore haunting places beyond reality, a liminal space unlike any you have ever been to and may never escape.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616090/0e77d9abbc3ec14705d90cac2d9944c21c763882/header.jpg?t=1782185627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616090/229129a01f1140b4f7a1a9ee80a5e33230271652/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782185627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616090/229129a01f1140b4f7a1a9ee80a5e33230271652/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782185627", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["nLabs"], "publishers": ["nLabs"], "demos": [{"appid": 4621110, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"win